#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "578\t651"
msgid "Hit a few for old time's sake?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal un poco de bateo, como antes?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1179\t1239"
msgid "Majima."
msgstr "Majima."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1351\t1542"
msgid "Stop playin'. Ya know why I came back, don't ya?"
msgstr "Ya sabes por qué regresé a esta ciudad, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1592\t1669"
msgid "To rendezvous with old man Sasai..."
msgstr "Para reencontrarte con el viejo Sasai..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1674\t1792"
msgid "Oh, and to get your revenge on me."
msgstr "Y para vengarte de mí, ¿no es así?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1801\t1948"
msgid "If ya know what I want,\\nwhy're you fuckin' around like this?"
msgstr "Si sabes lo que quiero,\\n¡¿Por qué estás haciendo todo esto?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1954\t2030"
msgid "I gotta know what went down that day in '85."
msgstr "Tengo derecho a saber la verdad de hace 25 años."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2035\t2140"
msgid "How come ya never showed n' backed me up!?"
msgstr "¡Quiero saber por qué no apareciste ese maldito día!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2538\t2631"
msgid "Answers, bro."
msgstr "Respóndeme, kyoudai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3097\t3219"
msgid "What's the hold up?\\nGet your ass over here."
msgstr "¿Qué estás haciendo?\\nApúrate y ven."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3264\t3377"
msgid "You didn't forget, did ya?\\nWhat we promised each other."
msgstr "¿Ya lo olvidaste?\\nNuestra promesa."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3448\t3599"
msgid "Minute we stepped foot into this world,\\nthe deal was sealed."
msgstr "Una vez que pones un pie en este mundo,\\nel código se cumple hasta el final."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3604\t3674"
msgid "Duty's everythin'."
msgstr "No voy a excusarme."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3695\t3858"
msgid "Friend or foe, or even sworn brother.\\nThe price for betrayal..."
msgstr "Si alguien llegase a traicionar el código, incluso siendo kyoudais.\\nEl precio de esa traición..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3859\t3910"
msgid "Is death."
msgstr "es la muerte."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3919\t4069"
msgid "That's the oath we swore,\\nthe day we became brothers."
msgstr "Esa es la promesa que hicimos,\\nel día en que nos juramos kyoudais."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4082\t4147"
msgid "'Course I remember."
msgstr "No hay forma de que lo olvide."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4155\t4242"
msgid "Every damn word of it."
msgstr "Recuerdo cada palabra."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4265\t4376"
msgid "Well whatever the reason, I betrayed ya."
msgstr "Sea cual sea la razón, te traicioné."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4386\t4488"
msgid "Couldn't help old man Sasai, either."
msgstr "Y tampoco pude salvar al viejo Sasai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4639\t4699"
msgid "Majima..."
msgstr "Majima..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4702\t4757"
msgid "Just strip, bro."
msgstr "Quítatela, kyoudai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4791\t4956"
msgid "We're settlin' this like good ol' times.\\nYa beat my ass, I talk."
msgstr "Arreglemos esto a golpes, como antes.\\nSi me pateas el culo, hablaré."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4979\t5093"
msgid "Gonna need a boatload of luck for that, though."
msgstr "Aunque dudo mucho que eso vaya a suceder."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5109\t5178"
msgid "So ya think I gone soft."
msgstr "No me trates como un debilucho."

